      "note": "Combined from CommonSGSetup.json (step1) + ZonalROAndDrillsUserViewsAndRunsRO_step2.json (step2) to reverify the RBAC-propagation race documented in ../KnownErrors.txt. Not hand-authored bicep; the two source files are concatenated with minimal dependsOn wiring added so step2's SG-scoped resources (goalAssignment, recoveryPlan, drill) explicitly wait on the serviceGroups resource created earlier in the SAME deployment, instead of in a separate, later deployment as the split design does."
